      587.49
    ],
    "text": "My No.: EDS/50/05/08. Land Ministry\u2019s Ref. No. : LD/05/2003/SM/210. I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude required for the Ministry of Buddha Sasana, Religious and Cultural Affairs, National Integration, Social Security and Mass Media :",
