      587.03,
      286.72,
      661.43
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land/servitude intended to be acquired : The land called Nagahakoratuwa in extent of 0.0179 Hectare situated at Karangoda Village of No. 186 Karangoda Grama Niladhari Division, Palle Paththuwa of Nawadun Koralaya, Elapatha Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division, Ratnapura District of Sabaragamuwa Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
